<title>POLAND: Polish food prices fall 0.7 pct in August 1-10.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices fall 0.7 pct in August 1-10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices fell 0.7 percent in the August 1-10 period after stabilising in the previous 10 days and were 0.9-percent lower than in the July 1-10 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>				  AUGUST 1-10  JULY 21-31  LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)     -0.7	   0.0	 -0.9 (-1.1)</p>
<p> Bread				0.2	   0.0	  0.3 (0.2)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	 -11.3	  -2.7	-16.5(-12.1)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	 1.8	   1.2	  3.6 (2.1)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.0	   0.1	  0.3 (0.6)</p>
<p> Eggs				 3.8	   1.1	  3.8 (-2.1)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period ending on July 31.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
